WEBVTT

00:03:58.956 --> 00:04:03.196
what the WHO tells us
is acceptable to breathe.

00:04:03.716 --> 00:04:07.996
Fossil fuels, everyone,
they're killing us.

00:04:08.876 --> 00:04:11.396
Almost one in five premature deaths

00:04:11.396 --> 00:04:13.396
are linked to air pollution

00:04:13.436 --> 00:04:16.596
from combustion engines,
coal power plants,

00:04:16.636 --> 00:04:20.636
wood burning, ammonia, cooking stoves

00:04:20.636 --> 00:04:22.316
and other fossil fuels.

00:04:23.236 --> 00:04:29.716
That is 8.7 million people a year
dying from heart attacks, cancer, strokes,

00:04:29.756 --> 00:04:35.476
dementia, suicide, depression,
stillbirths and miscarriages.